[en.FOCUS_C12_TOP_SECRET_PERFORMANCE_TECHNIQUE]
Top Secret Performance

[en.FOCUS_C12_TOP_SECRET_PERFORMANCE_TECHNIQUE_desc]
Among the drafts left behind by Pinkie Pie, we discovered an unpublished, incomplete musical score. Scientists attempted to have our military band perform these manuscripts, and the performance elicited… not-so-good reactions, leaving many of the onlooking soldiers with a sort of post-viewing trauma. Nonetheless, the scientists remain optimistic. They believe that with further refinements based on this foundation, we can create musical compositions even more passionately stirring than those of the past.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TOP_SECRET_PERFORMANCE_TECHNIQUE]
绝密演奏法

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TOP_SECRET_PERFORMANCE_TECHNIQUE_desc]
我们在萍琪遗留下来的草稿中发现她未曾公开过的残缺乐谱，科学家们试着将这些手稿交给了我们的军乐团并进行演出，并产生了...不那么好的反响，让许多围观的士兵产生了观看后遗症。不过，科学家仍然对此保留乐观态度，他们认为如果再此基础上继续加以改进，我们可以创作出比以往更激情澎湃的乐章

